msgid "Wait four weeks before closing the old account"
msgstr "Vier Wochen warten, bevor du das bisherige Konto schließt"

#: admin/views/hosting.php:310
msgid ""
"Apple asks for at least four weeks. Where no redirect is possible, change "
"the feed address in Apple Podcasts Connect and Spotify for Creators "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Apple verlangt mindestens vier Wochen. Wenn keine Weiterleitung möglich ist,"
" ändere die Feed-Adresse selbst in Apple Podcasts Connect und Spotify for "
"Creators."

