" Hörer gelangen."

#: includes/Hosting.php:251
msgid ""
"Enter your host’s RSS feed address (it starts with https://) to switch to "
"another host. Hosting stays on this website until then."
msgstr ""
"Gib zum Wechseln die RSS-Feed-Adresse deines Hosts mit https:// ein. Bis "
"dahin bleibt das Hosting auf dieser Website."

#: includes/Hosting.php:252
msgid ""
"Enter your host’s RSS feed address (it starts with https://). The address "
"saved before is kept."
msgstr ""
"Gib die RSS-Feed-Adresse deines Hosts mit https:// ein. Die bisherige "
"Adresse bleibt gespeichert."

#: includes/Hosting.php:258
msgid ""
"This address is this website’s own podcast feed. Choose the host’s feed "
